      {
        "id": 302,
        "name": "Notice - Evidence Submission Protocol for Lecture Absences",
        "instance": 8,
        "contextid": 15224,
        "description": "<div class=\"no-overflow\"><p id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1780849755614_908\"><strong id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1780849755614_938\">Notice - Evidence Submission Protocol for Lecture Absences</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dear students,<br><br>In the event of an absence, students must submit valid supporting documents, including medical certificates where applicable, containing the details below, to Ms. Sujeewa, Management Assistant of the Department of Accounting, within fourteen (14) days of the missed lecture.</p>\r\n<p>Name<br>CPM<br>MC<br>Department<br>Contact No.<br>The dates for which you provide evidence<br><br>Thank you<br>Course Coordinator</p></div>",
        "visible": 1,
        "uservisible": true,
        "visibleoncoursepage": 1,
        "modicon": "https://lms.mgt.sjp.ac.lk/theme/image.php/academi/label/1781718992/monologo?filtericon=1",
