      {
        "id": 2905,
        "name": "Dear Students, This message is for the students of...",
        "instance": 182,
        "contextid": 27660,
        "description": "<div class=\"no-overflow\"><p data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"50\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"50\">Dear Students,</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"105\">This message is for the students of the <strong data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"104\">A3 group</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"179\">Please note that there will be <strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"178\">no ACC1370 lecture on 10th August 2026</strong>. Instead, the lecture will be held on <strong>13th August </strong><strong data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"277\">2026 from 3.00 p.m. to 5.00 p.m. at Maslow Hall</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"179\">Thank you!</p></div>",
